  "slug": "sulfur-buckets",
  "title": "Sulfur Buckets",
  "description": "A 3D resouce pack for sulfur cube buckets",
  "body": "<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1d8ddc9a8196dfaef04580770b3dae7750539b79.png\" alt=\"Sulfur Buckets Title Logo\" width=\"720\">\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/sulfur-buckets\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/02bacf07968811f402433ea0ccc8e34c389fea78.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"64\"></a>\n  &nbsp;\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/sulfur-buckets\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/85e44936662bca117056479e5000d3576aebbcc9.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"64\"></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <strong>Supported Version:</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e14af3c74a5ca543f9a5dba19b6f6b544284fa9.png\" alt=\"Minecraft 1.26.2\" width=\"102\">\n</p>\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"58%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c980aacaf5b7aac659e89b551ea355a09cb8834b.gif\" alt=\"Ingame footage\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Ingame Footage</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"42%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3aaa3dc1779141699436c8bf7d9a456055499946.png\" alt=\"Image of inventory\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\">\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ca361b5260131768b5511e77612c275037fa3f92.png\" alt=\"On head\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>On Head*</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a94b3e4ea30ae4cc028bbbd751e2fe42181b043f.png\" alt=\"Dropped on ground\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Dropped*</strong>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n## Decide the Pack\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e398eea74d593a0359afc4ccad6ebf02b9425a97.png\" alt=\"On floor default pack\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Floor: Default Pack*</strong><br>\n      <sub>correct orientation</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b0931330f7b7b3d6350f103814113fbd630c8eb1.png\" alt=\"On floor wall pack\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Floor: Wall Pack*</strong><br>\n      <sub>wrong orientation</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/43780cb9d9eee586dfd093bce6493baceec09907.png\" alt=\"On wall default pack\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Wall: Default Pack*</strong><br>\n      <sub>wrong orientation</sub>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/206786ba9b74e1e0a1f954f9c5d8358211daa741.png\" alt=\"On wall wall pack\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Wall: Wall Pack*</strong><br>\n      <sub>correct orientation</sub>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Why are there two resource packs?</summary>\n\nEvery item frame has a red arrow: this is the direction the item frame points away from the block. The model also has one chosen direction, shown with the red arrow in the pack renders.\n\nMinecraft rotates the model so the model arrow lines up with the item frame arrow. The Default Pack is built with the arrow coming from below the cube, so it stands correctly on floor item frames. The Wall Pack is built with the arrow coming from the side of the cube, so it faces correctly on wall item frames. One pack cannot use both attachment directions at the same time, so both versions are included.\n\n<table width=\"100%\">\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7189e195b0fd248d33bc59a7065448c2cd9f7df9.png\" alt=\"Frame arrow floor\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Floor Frame*</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3deae7f862b8481a4a8bcd9d9cbda2b0fc9b2fd9.png\" alt=\"Cube arrow default pack\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Default Pack*</strong>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9c890a39607c1a91ea54d74de5e545a2f2fee57b.png\" alt=\"Frame arrow wall\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Wall Frame*</strong>\n    </td>\n    <td align=\"center\" width=\"50%\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a770d48c87bb59a9c722b6ba45ea9ea4ee38160e.png\" alt=\"Cube arrow wall pack\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto;\"><br>\n      <strong>Wall Pack*</strong>\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n</details>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><sub>* All images except the ingame footage and chest screenshot are renders.</sub></p>\n\n## Useful Commands\n\nInvisible item frame\n\n```mcfunction\n/give @p item_frame[entity_data={id:\"minecraft:item_frame\",Invisible:true}]\n```\n\nGlowing invisible item frame\n\n```mcfunction\n/give @p glow_item_frame[entity_data={id:\"minecraft:glow_item_frame\",Invisible:true}]\n```\n\nWear a cube on your head\n\n```mcfunction\n/item replace entity @s armor.head with minecraft:sulfur_cube_bucket[sulfur_cube_content={id:\"minecraft:tnt\"}]\n```\n",
